<title>USA: MVSI sees Q4 shr, sales rise.</title>
<headline>MVSI sees Q4 shr, sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>MVSI Inc said that it expects its second quarter profits to increase over the $0.05 a share reported in last year's second quarter.</p>
<p>Sales for the second quarter ending March 31, 1997 are expected to increase to approximately $10 million from $3 million in the year ago period, MVSI said.</p>
</text>
